#showas:要塞王之领域
Necromancer Empire
Difficulty: Brutal

The ultimate challenge for a necromancer, for those who know too much about their power and want to show their skills, featuring not only a D10 ai, but 3 ais in total, each with their own crafty attack style.

The D10 Fortress King is everywhere, showing its true defensive strength, you'll have plenty of ships to convert, provided you can beat them.

The D8 Spire Hammer is sneaky, able to deal incredible damage in a small amount of time, even though he's 2 difficulties lower, his ships are practically immune to necromany, and his somewhat rarer planets are tricky to attack

The D8 Quadratic... word of advice - don't let him get too many CPA bunkers. Though he himself is cowardly and fields few systems, when hiding between his 2 powerful brothers and given time, he can pose the largest threat of all.

Not only that, but there are opposing scourge out there, combined with the templar, they bring their own flavor of time pressure.

... speaking of which, did i mention that the templar and elderlings are maxed out in terms of difficulty?, for the true experience, play on challenger+ if you dare.

Pitiful Necromancer, surrounded in an undefensible galaxy with opposition on all sides. If your skills are truly as great as they say, dare you try to topple the Fortress King?